This solution iterates through the list of numbers, maintaining a running sum of the current ascending subarray. When it encounters a number that is not greater than the previous one, it compares the current sum to the maximum sum found so far and resets the current sum. Finally, it ensures the last subarray is considered by comparing it once more at the end.

